    ],
    title: '去县里拜访县长',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    bgm: '',
    presentation: {
      type: 'dialogue',
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '你现在手里有钱，这不稀奇。稀奇的是，你到底想拿这笔钱干什么。',
          speaker_key: 'important:xianzhang',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '我想做点真能改变县里的事，但也不想当冤大头。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
